#&gt; 
#&gt; ── Imputing missing values ──
#&gt; 
#&gt; ℹ Imputation method: `impute_miss_forest()`
#&gt; ℹ Reason: default for "glycomics" with n_samples &gt; 100.
#&gt; ✔ Imputation completed.
#&gt; 
#&gt; ── Aggregating data ──
#&gt; 
